{"id":"saatchi-root","ord":"a0","title":"saatchi — photograph an app doing the thing","desc":"The project folder for github.com/juspay/saatchi (local clone ~/code/saatchi): a standalone, app-neutral tool that runs a playwright section against a running app and produces screenshot/video evidence. Born from olai's lanes rebuilding evidence plumbing per-PR; the design is brainstorming/evidence-driver.md at this vault's root, settled with the human 2026-08-28.","created":"2026-08-28T14:56:26-04:00"}
